*.rar

# Demucs ONNX model pack (see demucs_README.md; install separately)
demucs.onnx/onnx-models/

# Prebuilt ONNX Runtime / cuDNN dumps if extracted next to the repo
onnxruntime-*/
cudnn*/
cuda_*/

# =============================================================================
# Git submodules (.gitmodules pins commits; avoid clone-specific noise)
# =============================================================================
# Submodule trees: never `git add` large vendored dumps from the superproject.
# Per-submodule CMake user presets (clone-specific; same idea as root CMakeUserPresets.json)
JUCE/CMakeUserPresets.json
demucs.onnx/CMakeUserPresets.json
modules/**/CMakeUserPresets.json